Essential Fish Habitat(13)
Contact the National Marine Fisheries Service only if the project will involve work within tidal waters or waters
designated as Essential Fish Habitat (EFH). EFH for Atlantic Salmon is listed in Appendix C of the US Army Corps of
Engineers General Permits for NH. Tributaries of the waters listed in Appendix C are also considered EFH if they
exhibit Atlantic Salmon habitat characteristics. EFH for Atlantic Salmon and for all other species can be found via
the EFH mapper tool.
Army Corps GPs for New Hampshire (https://www.nae.usace.army.mil/Missions/Regulatory/State-General-
Permits/New-Hampshire-General-Permit/
EFH Habitat Mapper (https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/resource/map/essential-fish-habitat-mapper)
